          "text": "Associated symptoms and relevant negatives"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No fevers, rigors, night sweats, chest pain, shortness of breath, palpitations, or haemoptysis. No significant calf swelling away from the affected area; no thigh pain. No rest pain or foot ulcers. No current leg wounds, ooze, or spreading cellulitis."
      }
